[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:"Paris in the Spring"]
[00:00.68]Lesson 85 | 第85课
[00:02.58]'Paris in the Spring'. | “春天的巴黎”。
[00:05.82]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.02]At what time of year did Ken visit Paris? | 肯是在一年中的什么时候访问巴黎的？
[00:17.46]Hello, Ken. | 你好，肯。
[00:20.02]Hi, George. | 嗨，乔治。
[00:21.96]Have you just been to the cinema? | 你刚去电影院了吗？
[00:25.02]Yes, I have. | 是的，我去了。
[00:27.06]What's on? | 正在放映什么？
[00:28.98]'Paris in the Spring'. | “春天的巴黎”。
[00:31.62]Oh, I've already seen it. | 哦，我已经看过了。
[00:34.36]I saw it on television last year. | 我去年在电视上看过。
[00:38.56]It's an old film, but it's very good. | 那是一部老电影，但非常好。
[00:43.34]Paris is a beautiful city. | 巴黎是一座美丽的城市。
[00:46.36]I've never been there. | 我从未去过那里。
[00:48.81]Have you ever been there, Ken? | 你去过那里吗，肯？
[00:51.83]Yes, I have. | 是的，我去过。
[00:53.90]I was there in April. | 我是四月份去的。
[00:56.99]Paris in the spring, eh? | 春天的巴黎，是吗？
[01:00.12]It was spring, but the weather was awful. | 那是春天，但天气很糟糕。
[01:04.62]It rained all the time. | 一直在下雨。
[01:07.34]Just like London! | 就像伦敦一样！